ADDITIONAL NOTICE — HEALTHCARE USE:

This Software provides documentation templates and decision-support "judgment
skills" (prompts pasted into AI assistants) intended as educational aids for
qualified Medical Technologists and laboratory professionals. It does NOT
diagnose and is not a substitute for professional clinical judgment, hospital
SOPs, or the standards of the relevant national authority (e.g., the National
Blood Centre, Thai Red Cross Society for transfusion practice). Generated or
AI-assisted content MUST be reviewed by appropriately qualified personnel before
use in clinical practice. The authors disclaim any responsibility for clinical
or operational decisions made based on this content.
